{"createdAt":1785080522349,"expiresAt":1785166922349,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=1845250&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"1845250":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rubinite","steam_appid":1845250,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4854050],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rubinite is an extremely challenging boss rush action game set in a dark fairy tale world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to combat is one distinctive core mechanic: Focus. Use Focus to read an enemy, <br>expose its weak point, and land a lethal strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ruby, a princess on a journey of revenge to reclaim her home: <strong>The Scarlet Kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/8f77a61c21f51537ab6b9966e76d8904.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=615 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/8f77a61c21f51537ab6b9966e76d8904.webm?t=1785055619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the Bloodstained to the Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruby’s blade alone will barely wound them. Find their weak points,<br>drive the lethal strike home, and make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/46db7a9030286393cd64de5abd39c551.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=640 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/46db7a9030286393cd64de5abd39c551.webm?t=1785055619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Bloodline: Both a Blessing and a Curse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To take back the Scarlet Kingdom, Ruby must face the Bloodstained in every form they take,<br> whether it be an ancient secret cult, undying parasites, or the source of a deadly plague. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grip your blade and challenge foes that grow deadlier with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/faa184095862c5f82b4fea2c047afd72.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=640 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/faa184095862c5f82b4fea2c047afd72.webm?t=1785055619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exquisite Pixel Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into beautifully crafted pixelated scenes, where the poignancy and grandeur of the Scarlet Kingdom come alive in every hazardous battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/1ec7a182c96b25922a83c865550eb4e2.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=640 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/1ec7a182c96b25922a83c865550eb4e2.webm?t=1785055619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Pureblood, Forge Talismans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Bloodstained you kill surrenders its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb it to grow stronger for the fight ahead, craft a wide range of Talismans, <br>and build a combat style that's entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/5030063eb5c40bc78a63006351623c1e.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=615 height=355 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/5030063eb5c40bc78a63006351623c1e.webm?t=1785055619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/a0346373cd66a1b4da6540783bca4095.apng?t=1785055619\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/a0346373cd66a1b4da6540783bca4095.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=130 /></picture></span></p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rubinite is an extremely challenging boss rush action game set in a dark fairy tale world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to combat is one distinctive core mechanic: Focus. Use Focus to read an enemy, <br>expose its weak point, and land a lethal strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ruby, a princess on a journey of revenge to reclaim her home: <strong>The Scarlet Kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/8f77a61c21f51537ab6b9966e76d8904.poster.avif?t=1785055619\" width=615 height=255 ><so